
    Garbage Collection ?

    Garbage Collection is the process of removing unreachable object from memory.


    Reachable                                   unreachable
    (in use)                                     (removed)   

         O                                          O
       ↗  ↖                                             O
      O     O                                       O       
        

    ->  ***  Helps to free memory and avoid memory leaks.   ***